It is very sunny and I am happy.
The weather will stay nice today.
There I see a small bakery.
I go inside.
A shop assistant stands at the till.
She smiles at me kindly.
"Good afternoon!"
"What would you like?" she asks.
"Good afternoon!"
"A piece of cake, please," I answer.
"And a coffee with it, please."
"Gladly," says the shop assistant.
She gives me the cake and the coffee.
"That makes five Euro eighty, please," she says.
I give her six Euros.
She gives me twenty Cents back.
"Do you need the receipt?" she asks.
"No, thank you," I say.
I take my coffee and my cake.
Then I go back outside into the sun.
